    {
      "id": 3832,
      "sender_id": 118,
      "content": "<p>Hi <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"25\">@YZ</span>, could you help take a look at this run?</p>\n<p><code>s2run_8375dc42-4504-46e2-bd51-03e8feca718b</code></p>\n<p>Two of the <code>fin4</code> countermodel cases took unusually long—about 185s and 479s. Do you know what might be causing the slowdown? Thanks!<br>\n<img alt=\"企业微信20260820-185703@2x.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"2902x1616\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/5/1d/wSt5WzP6fJphb5CNnV2J0GZ3/20260820-1857032x.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/5/1d/wSt5WzP6fJphb5CNnV2J0GZ3/20260820-1857032x.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
