      "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"118\">@Bing Wu</span> We investigated and reproduced the your case. The Fin 4 countermodel search itself was fast, and most of the runtime was spent in an earlier search stage that eventually timed out without finding a result.<br>\nThe difference between 185s and 479s is due to the problem-specific search workload.</p>",
